  "dataSourcesScreenMessage1": "Location and times",
  "dataSourcesScreenMessage2": "The prayer location and calculation method are kept on the device, and the times are calculated on the device without sending the coordinates to any server. You can change them on the prayer screen. The qibla uses the location permission to find the direction. The permission can be withdrawn in the device settings.",
  "dataSourcesScreenMessage3": "Data and reminders",
  "dataSourcesScreenMessage4": "Favourites, bookmarks, the khatma and settings are kept on the device. Clearing the app''s data in the system settings removes them. Reminders are local and need no remote messaging service. When crash reports are available you can turn them on or off in Settings; location, searches and reading history are never added to them. External services may receive connection data. Deleting local data does not delete records or backups held by external services.",
