  "dataSourcesScreenMessage6": "The Quran, hadith and duas are in the app''s files so they work offline. The Uthmani mushaf text is from the Tanzil project (tanzil.net), shown unchanged. Documentation of the edition, source, licence and review approval for each collection is not complete yet. File integrity checks detect changes; they are not a religious certification of the content.",
